    "notes": "T10. Six actual stages each facing. Physically explicit staging keeps existing launcher secured low on LEFT side during LEFT shield bash, then LEFT fingers visibly draw it while that forearm shield folds, then raise/aim, mechanical recoil and recovery. Empty attachment during rightA2 is not a second launcher: no red receiver there. LEFT launcher and LEFT shield remain on their anatomical side; right wrist blades retracted. Independent QA review approved new03A pages and selected oldB complements. Right01b LEFT5 with missing launcher is excluded; old incorrect03/02 bash cells are excluded. No hit-confirm, super resource, actual bolt entity, inventory state, damage or duel binding is added. Fixed standing references and reviewed feet midpoint anchors. Calibrations are excluded; playback durations are for visual inspection, not source mechanics."
